    "teacherReflection": "Reflect on the lesson: Which properties of rotation did learners find through their own measurements, and which did I have to tell them? How many learners confused clockwise and anticlockwise or the sign of the angle, and how will I address this in Lesson 3? Did learners connect equal distances OA = OA' to the idea that the centre is fixed, which will help them find the centre by perpendicular bisectors next lesson? Did the globe model help them see that Kenya turns without changing shape or distance? Which DQB questions are ready to be revisited?",
