      "skills": "Constructing perpendicular bisectors with a ruler and compass. Plotting points on a grid. Measuring angles with a protractor. Using tracing paper to check a rotation. Using Analysing and Interpreting Data and Using Mathematics (NGSS practices) to link an angle to an Earth-time calculation. Constructing Explanations from evidence.",
      "attitudes": "Precision and patience in constructions. Collaboration and respect for peers' reasoning. Curiosity about how mathematics describes the turning Earth beneath Kenya.",
